@startuml F4.2c-atribuir-orientador
title F4.2c — Atribuir a outro orientador (AssignmentBoard)
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Professor" as Prof
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "COEController" as Ctrl
participant "GetCOEMembersUC" as Members
participant "AssignInternshipUC" as Assign
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Prof -> WebApp: Abrir AssignmentBoard
WebApp -> Jwt: GET /comissoes/coe/membros
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> Members: execute(...)
Members -> Postgres: SELECT membros + carga
Postgres --> Members: lista
Members --> WebApp: 200
Prof -> WebApp: Confirmar orientador
WebApp -> Jwt: POST /comissoes/coe/atribuicoes
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> Assign: execute(...)
Assign -> Postgres: UPDATE assignee\n+ outbox (orientador+aluno)
Postgres --> Assign: OK (COMMIT)
Assign --> WebApp: 200
WebApp --> Prof: linha com responsável

@enduml
